  "name": "Autumn Apple Salad",
  "subtitle": "A crisp fruit salad with yogurt, almonds, and dried fruit",
  "description": "Chopped green apples are folded with toasted almonds, dried cranberries, dried cherries, and vanilla yogurt for a quick, creamy salad.",
